commit 9228514f184286277979d94aabf6961191739ce2
Author: Jack Shelton <me@jackshelton.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 11 01:42:24 2026 -0500

    feat: land factoriolab aggregate/conformance/trust transition — first Angular matrix cell

    Derived append tool appends ONE member (the three build-lane receipts
    are sealed inside the witness receipt by digest and bytes — the lineage
    difference is asserted by tests, not smoothed into a fake pair).
    Measured post-append: 21 receipts, 14 verticals, 7 source applications,
    19 matrix cells, 34 resolvedDependencies. angularLineage coverage
    honestly unchanged at 1/4 with counted:false pending Judge. Every pin
    moved to exact measured values; nothing loosened; payment-signals
    untouched (7-digit max run never reaches panLike). 1000/1000.

